<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We may not know, we cannot tell,</l><l>What pains He had to bear;</l><l>But we believe it was for us</l><l>He hung and suffered there.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He died that we might be forgiven,</l><l>He died to make us good,</l><l>That we might from our sins be freed,</l><l>Saved by His precious blood.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>There was no other good enough</l><l>To pay the price of sin,</l><l>He only could divine life give</l><l>And dwell Himself within.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
